\b Factory Workbench development installer\b0\par\par
This development build is unsigned. Install it only from a build and installation profile you trust.\par\par
Setup installs machine-wide tools and a runtime payload. The guided setup then signs you into Entra, enrolls this machine with your plant, and installs a dedicated boot-time Windows Service. Your account must own the plant or have plant-scoped registration authority.\par\par
Worker execution and WSL integration are disabled. The plant reports connected machines as not ready for execution.\par\par
Uninstall removes the service and owned runtime releases but retains machine identity, configuration, certificates, and journals. Uninstall does not revoke the remote identity.\par\par
Do not treat this development build as a signed production distribution or a cold-boot acceptance result.\par
